<title>USA: IRT in talks with possible partner.</title>
<headline>IRT in talks with possible partner.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN, N.J. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>IRT Holding Corp said Thursday it is in discussions with a potential stratetic partner.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate.</p>
<p>The company also said it is negotiating with several major health maintenance organizations and health care service organizations regarding IRT providing treatment for asthma and other allergic diseases.</p>
